<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Tender Awarded</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --primary-color: #059669;
        --secondary-color: #047857;
        --text-color: #1f2937;
        --background-light: #f8fafc;
        --white: #ffffff;
      }
      body { font-family: sans-serif; margin: 20px; background-color: var(--background-light); }
      .email-wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background-color: var(--white); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
      .email-header { background-color: var(--primary-color); color: var(--white); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
      .email-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }
      .email-content { padding: 40px 30px; }
      .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .info-card { background-color: #f0fff4; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color); padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 8px; }
      .cta-button { display: inline-block; background-color: var(--primary-color); color: var(--white) !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
      .email-footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1 class="email-title">🎉 Congratulations!</h1>
            <p>You have been awarded the tender.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-content">
            <div class="greeting">Hello {{bidderName}},</div>
            <p>We are pleased to inform you that your bid for <strong>{{tenderTitle}}</strong> has been successful.</p>
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Award Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Tender Number:</strong> {{tenderNumber}}</p>
                <p><strong>Your Bid Number:</strong> {{bidNumber}}</p>
                <p><strong>Contract Value:</strong> ${{contractValue}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>Our team will be in touch shortly with the next steps regarding the contract.</p>
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
                <a href="{{bidLink}}" class="cta-button">View Award Details</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Infrasoko. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>